OL,3,ARussian warship hit by Ukrainian drones
OL,4,Ain Libya, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian warship was sunk by Ukrainian
OL,7,Fdrones at a port in Libya on Sunday,
OL,8,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,10,FThere was an explosion on the warship
OL,11,Fat the Benghazi naval base in the early
OL,12,Fmorning, while it was docking for fuel
OL,13,Fand supplies ahead of its return to
OL,14,FRussia, local authorities said.
OL,16,FZelensky added that Ukraine's attack
OL,17,Fhit a second Russian vessel, a cargo
OL,18,Fship which he claimed was being used to
OL,19,Ftransport weapons.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
